    "en": {
      "trackName": "Triple Tap For Watch",
      "description": "Triple Tap — the satisfying tile-matching puzzle, built for Apple Watch.\n\nTap tiles to send them to your tray. Collect three of a kind to clear them and free up space. Work through stacked layers to clear the whole board — addictive triple-match puzzling, now right on your wrist. No phone needed.\n\nWHY YOU'LL LOVE IT\n• One-tap play — no dragging, perfect for a quick round\n• 100 hand-crafted levels, from easy to expert\n• Every board is guaranteed solvable — no dead ends\n• Combo clears & star ratings to chase\n• Bright, friendly tile art designed for a small screen\n• Play fully offline, anytime — a 1-minute game on your wrist\n• Progress saved automatically\n• Built native for Apple Watch — no iPhone required\n\nIn line, on a break, or winding down — a glance at your wrist turns into a satisfying match.",
